# Created once by chezmoi (`create_` prefix) and never rewritten afterwards, so blocks
# appended by installers (Kiro CLI, AIM CLI, kiro-cmux, ...) can live here without
# blocking `chezmoi apply`.
#
# The real configuration is in ~/.config/zsh/, which chezmoi does manage. Put anything
# you want version-controlled there, not here.

# Must run before anything else touches the tty -- see the comments in 00-early.zsh.
[[ -r "${HOME}/.config/zsh/00-early.zsh" ]] && source "${HOME}/.config/zsh/00-early.zsh"

[[ -r "${HOME}/.config/zsh/10-zshrc.zsh" ]] && source "${HOME}/.config/zsh/10-zshrc.zsh"
